7.
Subject Matter of Bye-Laws.
- The Multi-State Co-operative Society and its branches : -
(i)
the name and registered address of the Multi-State Co-operative Society and its branches;
(ii)
the area of operation;
(iii)
the objects for which the Multi-State Co-operative Society is established and the purpose for which its funds may be
Page 3/16

